WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.860
Choose the PDF you want to take pages from.

2
00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:09.020
Type the pages you want to keep, for example 3, and 5 to 6.

3
00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:11.420
Then click Make PDF.

4
00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:15.170
Your new PDF has just those pages. Click Save.

5
00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:18.980
Your original PDF is not changed, and nothing left your device.
